    "title": "Boonton Man Arrested for Drug Possession and Traffic Violations - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Frank Cahill ,\n1 hours ago HANOVER TOWNSHIP — On Monday, August 11, James Gianguercio, a 45-year-old resident of Boonton, was arrested by Police Officer Michael Kaiser of the Hanover Township Police Department. The arrest followed a report of a potentially intoxicated driver, which led Officer Kaiser to conduct a motor vehicle stop on Whippany Road. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
